     <article class="story single" data-beat="national">
       <div class="meta"><span class="beat-tag">NATIONAL</span> · The Hindu · 2026-11-01 · editor 10/10 · 1 min read <span class="badge ok">fact-checked</span><span class="badge quick">quick bite</span></div>
       <h1>APSRTC Launches Sustainable Lifestyle Week With Yoga Sessions</h1>
       <div class="tags"><span>#national</span> <span>#brief</span></div>
       <p>The Andhra Pradesh State Road Transport Corporation (APSRTC) inaugurated its BRICS Sustainable Lifestyle Week on Sunday with a yoga session at RTC House in Vijayawada. Approximately 50 employees participated in the event, which focused on the theme of adopting healthy lifestyles.</p><img class="hero-art" src="/img/2026-11-01/apsrtc-launches-sustainable-lifestyle-week-with-yoga-session.webp" width="1200" height="675" alt="" loading="eager" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async"><p>Instructors demonstrated asanas to highlight stress management and physical fitness, while officials encouraged staff to integrate wellness into their daily routines. The week-long campaign continues through November 7 across all 129 depots, addressing environmental topics including water conservation, waste management, and the reduction of single-use plastics.</p>
       <p class="critique">Editor's note: The brief accurately reflects the scope, theme, and logistics of the campaign as detailed in the source.</p>
       <div class="provenance">
