      <ul><li><a href="https://www.thehindu.com/news/national/andhra-pradesh/apsrtc-kicks-off-brics-sustainable-lifestyle-week-with-yoga-programme/article71652630.ece" rel="noopener">The Hindu</a></li></ul>
      <p>AI-generated and fact-checked against the original report; claims the gate cannot verify are held back.</p>
    </div>
       
