     <article class="story single" data-beat="national">
       <div class="meta"><span class="beat-tag">NATIONAL</span> · The Hindu · 2026-11-01 · editor 9/10 · 1 min read <span class="badge ok">fact-checked</span><span class="badge quick">quick bite</span></div>
       <h1>BDA finalizes site for 250-metre Bengaluru skydeck project</h1>
       <div class="tags"><span>#national</span> <span>#brief</span></div>
       <p>The Bangalore Development Authority (BDA) has finalized 46.25 acres in Nadaprabhu Kempegowda Layout for a 250-metre-high skydeck. The project, estimated at ₹500 crore, has received Cabinet approval, and the BDA is currently preparing to invite Expressions of Interest for design proposals.</p><img class="hero-art" src="/img/2026-11-01/bda-finalizes-site-for-250-metre-bengaluru-skydeck-project.webp" width="1200" height="675" alt="" loading="eager" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async"><p>The chosen site near Challaghatta Metro station offers strong connectivity via S.M. Krishna Main Road. While the BDA is working to relocate affected land beneficiaries, officials are evaluating whether to implement the project through Public-Private Partnership or Engineering, Procurement, and Construction models.</p>
       <p class="critique">Editor's note: Accurate summary of the BDA project status and site selection, though it slightly simplifies the complexity of the site acquisition process.</p>
       <div class="provenance">
      <b>Source</b>
      <ul><li><a href="https://www.thehindu.com/news/cities/bangalore/skydeck-project-gathers-pace-as-bda-begins-preparatory-works/article71652644.ece" rel="noopener">The Hindu</a></li></ul>
      <p>AI-generated and fact-checked against the original report; claims the gate cannot verify are held back.</p>
    </div>
       <div class="cityguide"><b>City guide</b><p>More on <a href="https://bharatdn.com/city/bengaluru/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Bengaluru</a> - census 2011 population, live weather and air quality, local food and getaways.</p></div>
       <div class="sharebar" data-href="/article/2026-11-01/bda-finalizes-site-for-250-metre-bengaluru-skydeck-project" data-title="BDA finalizes site for 250-metre Bengaluru skydeck project"><b>Share:</b>
