     <article class="story single" data-beat="national">
       <div class="meta"><span class="beat-tag">NATIONAL</span> · India Today · 2026-11-01 · editor 9/10 · 1 min read <span class="badge ok">fact-checked</span></div>
       <h1>Delhi Traders Report Losses During Opposition Rally at Ramlila Maidan</h1>
       <div class="tags"><span>#national</span> <span>#brief</span></div>
       <p>Delhi traders report severe business losses as an opposition INDIA bloc rally at Ramlila Maidan forces the closure of 80 percent of shops in central and old Delhi markets. The Chamber of Trade and Industry requested that Rahul Gandhi postpone the event until after Diwali to protect festive commerce. Traders cite traffic congestion and barricaded routes as primary obstacles preventing shoppers from accessing markets like Chandni Chowk and Sadar Bazar.</p><img class="hero-art" src="/img/2026-11-01/delhi-traders-report-losses-during-opposition-rally-at-ramli.webp" width="1200" height="675" alt="" loading="eager" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async"><p>Opposition leaders gathered to demand the removal of Chief Election Commissioner Gyanesh Kumar, citing alleged irregularities in voter roll revisions. While organizers urged supporters to patronize local businesses, trade associations remain concerned over the economic impact of the large-scale political demonstration.</p>
       <p class="critique">Editor's note: The brief effectively synthesizes the economic impact of the rally and the specific political demands mentioned in the source.</p>
       <div class="provenance">
      <b>Source</b>
      <ul><li><a href="https://www.indiatoday.in/india/video/delhi-traders-warn-of-losses-ahead-of-opposition-rally-as-markets-near-ramlila-maidan-shut-ytvd-3029754-2026-11-01?utm_source=rss" rel="noopener">India Today</a></li></ul>
      <p>AI-generated and fact-checked against the original report; claims the gate cannot verify are held back.</p>
    </div>
       <div class="cityguide"><b>City guide</b><p>More on <a href="https://bharatdn.com/city/delhi/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Delhi</a> - census 2011 population, live weather and air quality, local food and getaways.</p></div>
       <div class="sharebar" data-href="/article/2026-11-01/delhi-traders-report-losses-during-opposition-rally-at-ramli" data-title="Delhi Traders Report Losses During Opposition Rally at Ramlila Maidan"><b>Share:</b>
