     <article class="story single" data-beat="entertainment">
       <div class="meta"><span class="beat-tag">ENTERTAINMENT</span> · Bollywood Hungama · 2026-11-01 · editor 10/10 · 1 min read <span class="badge ok">fact-checked</span></div>
       <h1>Himesh Reshammiya praises Salman Khan and Akshay Kumar as musically conscious</h1>
       <div class="tags"><span>#entertainment</span> <span>#brief</span></div>
       <p>Music composer Himesh Reshammiya has lauded actors Salman Khan and Akshay Kumar for their musical consciousness. In a recent interview, Reshammiya also identified Bhushan Kumar, the Taurani brothers, and Ratan Jain as highly knowledgeable music producers. Regarding his past collaboration with Deepika Padukone, Reshammiya emphasized that she is irreplaceable, noting that her eventual superstardom was evident even during their early work together.</p><img class="hero-art" src="/img/2026-11-01/himesh-reshammiya-praises-salman-khan-and-akshay-kumar-as-mu.webp" width="1200" height="675" alt="" loading="eager" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async"><p>Reshammiya further expressed a strong desire to collaborate with director Sandeep Reddy Vanga, stating he would choose him over others without hesitation. The composer also revealed he has written and composed 15 songs in English, including one he believes is suitable for Rihanna.</p>
       <p class="critique">Editor's note: The brief effectively captures the key quotes and sentiments from the source while remaining within the target word count.</p>
       <div class="provenance">
      <b>Source</b>
      <ul><li><a href="https://www.bollywoodhungama.com/news/features/deepika-padukone-is-irreplaceable-i-love-sandeep-reddy-vanga-salman-khan-akshay-kumar-are-musically-conscious-himesh-reshammiya/" rel="noopener">Bollywood Hungama</a></li></ul>
      <p>AI-generated and fact-checked against the original report; claims the gate cannot verify are held back.</p>
    </div>
       
