       <div class="meta"><span class="beat-tag">NATIONAL</span> · India Today · 2026-11-01 · editor 9/10 · 1 min read <span class="badge ok">fact-checked</span></div>
       <h1>Kerala Police Chief addresses Kochi hit-and-run investigation lapses</h1>
       <div class="tags"><span>#national</span> <span>#brief</span></div>
       <p>Kerala Police Chief Ravada A. Chandrasekhar has defended the investigation into a fatal Kochi hit-and-run, stating that strong action was taken against officials following identified lapses. The case involved a 17-year-old driver, the son of a judge, whose vehicle struck and killed a 55-year-old scooter rider. Authorities suspended officers for failing to include relevant sections of the law in the initial FIR.</p><img class="hero-art" src="/img/2026-11-01/kerala-police-chief-addresses-kochi-hit-and-run-investigatio.webp" width="1200" height="675" alt="" loading="eager" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async"><p>While the minor was initially granted bail, additional charges were later added. The accused's father remains under investigation, though the High Court has barred his arrest. Separately, the Chief is reviewing CCTV footage of an alleged assault involving political workers inside a police station.</p>
       <p class="critique">Editor's note: The brief is accurate and concise. Minor note: the source text refers to the Police Chief as Ravada A Chandrasekhar, while other public records might differ, but the brief correctly reflects the provided source material.</p>
       <div class="provenance">
      <b>Source</b>
      <ul><li><a href="https://www.indiatoday.in/india/story/kochi-mercedes-crash-kerala-police-chief-defends-action-fir-lapse-ptag-3029751-2026-11-01?utm_source=rss" rel="noopener">India Today</a></li></ul>
      <p>AI-generated and fact-checked against the original report; claims the gate cannot verify are held back.</p>
    </div>
       <div class="cityguide"><b>City guide</b><p>More on <a href="https://bharatdn.com/city/kochi/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Kochi</a> - census 2011 population, live weather and air quality, local food and getaways.</p></div>
       <div class="sharebar" data-href="/article/2026-11-01/kerala-police-chief-addresses-kochi-hit-and-run-investigatio" data-title="Kerala Police Chief addresses Kochi hit-and-run investigation lapses"><b>Share:</b>
